OL,3,GNEWSAIntegrated education campaigners
OL,4,Ahave 'lost their way' says minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners for integrated education in
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland have "lost their way",
OL,8,FStormont's education minister has said.
OL,10,FPaul Givan said there was a need for
OL,11,F"real and frank conversations" about
OL,12,Fthe sector and how "real integration"
OL,13,Fis achieved.
OL,15,FHe said many integrated schools have
OL,16,Ffaced "significant challenges in
OL,17,Fachieving and sustaining" what are
OL,18,Fregarded as "reasonable numbers" of
OL,19,Fboth Catholic and Protestant pupils.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
