OL,3,GNEWSAIntegrated education campaigners
OL,4,Ahave 'lost their way' says minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn response, two organisations which
OL,7,Fsupport integrated education said it
OL,8,F"cannot be reduced to just numbers of
OL,9,FProtestant and Catholic children alone"
OL,10,Fand added that parental demand for the
OL,11,Fsector "cannot be ignored".
